<p>Haye akbar.. Haye zainab..(2)</p> 
<p>Marne ki ijazat jab maangi<br> akbar ne to yeh sarwar ne kaha<br> zainab se ijazat lo beta<br> tum par hai ziyada haq uska<br> khaime mein phuphi amma ke jab<br> athhara baras wala pohcha<br> maangi jo ijazat akbar ne<br> zainab ne pukara aye beta</p> 
<p>Atthara baras tumko in haatho'n se paala hai<br> Atthara baras tumko in haatho'n se paala hai..(2)<br> Mai kaise kahu akbar..<br> Mai kaise kahu akbar, marne ke liye jao<br> Atthara baras tumko in haatho'n se paala hai</p> 
<p>1. Akbar tujhe dekhu to chalti hai meri saa'nse<br> kis tarha se tujhe zakhmi dekhengi meri aankhein<br> dekhengi meri aankhein<br> Mere gul badan, mere naujawa'n<br> kaleje mein jab, lagegi sina<br> meri jaan tum, na seh paoge<br> tumhe kis tarha sambhalegi maa<br> maloom hai zainab ko, nazuk tera seena hai</p> 
<p>Mai kaise kahu akbar..<br> Mai kaise kahu akbar, marne ke liye jao<br> Atthara baras tumko in haatho'n se paala hai</p> 
<p>2. Ek baar zara apne baba ki taraf dekho<br> kis tarha uthaenge woh tere janaze ko<br> woh tere janaze ko<br> ajab haal hai, kamar mein hai khum<br> hai abbas ki, judayi ka ghum<br> ghareeb ul watan, bohot thak chuka<br> zaeefi bhi hai, nazar bhi hai kam<br> aye laal mera bhai seh roz ka pyaasa hai</p> 
<p>Mai kaise kahu akbar..<br> Mai kaise kahu akbar, marne ke liye jao<br> Atthara baras tumko in haatho'n se paala hai</p> 
<p>3. Mai paalne wali hu itna to mera haq hai<br> socha tha ke ek din mai jab jaungi duniya se<br> jab jaungi duniya se<br> lahad mein mujhe, utarega tu<br> ye armaan hai, yehi aarzu<br> rahe tu sadaa, mere saamne<br> ruke saans bhi, tere ru baru<br> aye laal abhi mera armaan adhura hai</p> 
<p>Mai kaise kahu akbar..<br> Mai kaise kahu akbar, marne ke liye jao<br> Atthara baras tumko in haatho'n se paala hai</p> 
<p>4. Jab pehle pehel tujhko haatho pe uthaya tha<br> yeh kehte hue maine seene se lagaya tha<br> seene se lagaya tha<br> meri zindagi, mere laadle<br> kisi ki tujhe, nazar na lage<br> tujhe dekhne ko, bechayn thi<br> sukoo'n mil gaya, tujhe dekh ke<br> tu aankho'n ka taara hai tu raaj dulara hai</p> 
<p>Mai kaise kahu akbar..<br> Mai kaise kahu akbar, marne ke liye jao<br> Atthara baras tumko in haatho'n se paala hai</p> 
<p>5. Sughra se kiya waada kya yaad nahi akbar<br> beemar madine mein mar jaye na ro ro kar<br> mar jaye na ro ro kar<br> use aas hai, ke aoge tum<br> jo waada kiya, nibhaoge tum<br> sakina se woh, bohot door hai<br> bahan se use, milaoge tum<br> beta tumhe sughra se woh waada nibhana hai</p> 
<p>Mai kaise kahu akbar..<br> Mai kaise kahu akbar, marne ke liye jao<br> Atthara baras tumko in haatho'n se paala hai</p> 
<p>6. Akbar teri shadi ka armaa'n hai bohot humko<br> hum seh nahi payenge aye laal tere ghum ko<br> aye laal tere ghum ko<br> jabee'n par teri, jo sehra bandhe<br> tamanna hai woh, phuphi dekhle<br> dulhan ko teri, sajaungi mai<br> aye mere hasee'n, jawa'n laadle<br> zainab ne abhi tujhko dulha bhi banana hai</p> 
<p>Mai kaise kahu akbar..<br> Mai kaise kahu akbar, marne ke liye jao<br> Atthara baras tumko in haatho'n se paala hai</p> 
<p>7. Yeh kehne lage akbar zainab ki sadaa sunke<br> afzal to nahi amma mai dilbar e zahra se<br> mai dilbar e zahra se<br> akele hai wo, nahi hai koi<br> musibat mein hai, zarurat meri<br> nazar kis tarha, milaunga mai<br> agar aap ne, ijazat na di<br> kyu aapke hoto'n pe is waqt yeh nauha hai</p> 
<p>Mai kaise kahu akbar..<br> Mai kaise kahu akbar, marne ke liye jao<br> Atthara baras tumko in haatho'n se paala hai</p> 
<p>8. Akbar ki sadaa sunkar zainab ne ijazat di<br> rukhsat jo hue akbar kaisi woh qayamat thi<br> kaisi woh qayamat thi<br> duaein khuda, se karti thi woh<br> mere laal ki, khuda khayr ho<br> kaha Ya Ali, madad kijiye<br> mai rukhsat karu, jawa'n laal ko<br> zeeshan o raza phir na zainab ne pukara hai</p> 
<p>Mai kaise kahu akbar..<br> Mai kaise kahu akbar, marne ke liye jao<br> Atthara baras tumko in haatho'n se paala hai</p>